## Viet Template sample using VTL-compatible core syntax.
<div class="user-card">
  <h2>$user.displayName</h2>

  #if($user.admin)
    <span class="badge">Administrator</span>
  #else
    <span class="badge">User</span>
  #end

  <ul>
  #foreach($role in $user.roles)
    <li>$role</li>
  #end
  </ul>
</div>
